.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void \fBcsmp::StatisticalAnalyzer\fP< dim >::DefineBins (const char * bin_file, HistogramBins & data) const"

.PP
specify via ascii input file, the x-axis range of the histogram columns, i\&.e\&. the bin size Function defines the bins for the histogram on the basis of the user input as specified in file which is read by this function\&. The file should contain the following information:

.PP
title number of bin-dilimiter values (integer) bin bound values (floating point) EOF

.PP
\fBExample\fP 'myfile\&.bins' 8 1\&.0e-5 2\&.0e-5 4\&.0e-5 6\&.0e-5 8\&.0e-5 1\&.0e-4 2\&.0e-4 6\&.0e-4 EOF 
