.SS "template<uint32_t dim> void \fBcsmp::StatisticalAnalyzer\fP< dim >::RegionPropertyHistogramsElement (const char * prop, const HistogramBins & bins, std::map< std::string, std::pair< HistogramBins, size_t > > & results) const"

.PP
analyzes properties element by element interpolating variables to barycenter if necessary Goes through all Regions of current \fBModel\fP and calculates the area/volume of the region with property values within the ranges defined in 'bins'\&. Normalizes the computed values by the total area/volume of the \fBRegion\fP\&. Returns a map of bins and area/volume normalized values for each region using the region name as key / identifier\&. 
